  "body": "For example, the PDU examples have `\"ed25519:key_version:\": \"86BytesOfSignatureOfTheRedactedEvent\"` which doesn't really show what the expected value could look like.\r\n\r\nInstead, we should go through all the examples and make them match a real world example (replacing domain names with example.org). Ideally, those examples would have all or most of the possible characters present to show that things like `+` and `-` can be in some event IDs.",
